ub.com/godotengine/godot/tree/3.6). Yes, we'll be also releasing godot 3.6.2 soon with these changes.\n\nAwesome, thank you for the quick reply!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3397523081/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3403183746","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110852#issuecomment-3403183746","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110852","id":3403183746,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7K2HaC","user":{"login":"davekaa","id":14123538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTIzNTM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14123538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davekaa","html_url":"https://github.com/davekaa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davekaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davekaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davekaa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davekaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davekaa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davekaa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davekaa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davekaa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davekaa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T18:54:44Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T18:54:44Z","body":"> > Hello [@syntaxerror247](https://github.com/syntaxerror247), thank you for replying.\n> > Sorry, how can I access the update so I can build the Android version correctly? Should I check out a specific commit, or will you be uploading a new Godot release?\n> > Thank you!\n> \n> You can create a custom build from the [3.6 branch](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/tree/3.6). Yes, we'll be also releasing godot 3.6.2 soon with these changes.\n\nGoogle's deadline is November 1, can you tell if Godot 3.6.2 comes out before that?\n\nIf not, what do you mean with \"create a custom build for the 3.6 branch\"? Do you mean that this issue is already fixed in Godot 3.6.X? Or do you mean to create a custom android export template?\n\nThanks in advance!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3403183746/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3419215946","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110852#issuecomment-3419215946","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110852","id":3419215946,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LzRhK","user":{"login":"theautisticone799","id":230990996,"node_id":"U_kgDODcSklA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230990996?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theautisticone799","html_url":"https://github.com/theautisticone799","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theautisticone799/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theautisticone799/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theautisticone799/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theautisticone799/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theautisticone799/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theautisticone799/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theautisticone799/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theautisticone799/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theautisticone799/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-19T04:57:37Z","updated_at":"2025-10-19T04:57:37Z","body":"> > > Hello [@syntaxerror247](https://github.com/syntaxerror247), thank you for replying.\n> > > Sorry, how can I access the update so I can build the Android version correctly? Should I check out a specific commit, or will you be uploading a new Godot release?\n> > > Thank you!\n> > \n> > \n> > You can create a custom build from the [3.6 branch](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/tree/3.6). Yes, we'll be also releasing godot 3.6.2 soon with these changes.\n> \n> Google's deadline is November 1, can you tell if Godot 3.6.2 comes out before that?\n> \n> If not, what do you mean with \"create a custom build for the 3.6 branch\"? Do you mean that this issue is already fixed in Godot 3.6.X? Or do you mean to create a custom android export template?\n> \n> Thanks in advance!\n\n\nNot sure when 3.6.2 will come out,\n\nBut what they meant with \"create a custom build for the 3.6 branch\" is building the export templates from the current 3.6 branch source code, not sure if you need to compile the Editor too though, try and tell us if it works","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3419215946/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3430894256","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110852#issuecomment-3430894256","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110852","id":3430894256,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Mf0qw","user":{"login":"jahkosha","id":207419646,"node_id":"U_kgDODFz4_g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207419646?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha","html_url":"https://github.com/jahkosha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-22T07:51:10Z","updated_at":"2025-10-22T07:52:18Z","body":"There is many people that require this to be available before the end of the deadline **which is in 8 days**.\n\nWe are talking here about the LTS version of godot, which is suppose to still be supported, so I think it's fair to expect an official release before that delay.\n\nThat just sounds a bit embarrassing to ask all users of the LTS to compile the engine (and the templates) from source in order to be able to benefit from support.\n\nWhat can we do to help bringing 3.6.2 in time?\n\nAnyway if we can not get official support on that, and if some one do eventually compile the templates, **please share them with the community** so we don't all have to suffer the same way.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3430894256/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3432031002","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110852#issuecomment-3432031002","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110852","id":3432031002,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MkKMa","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-22T12:04:18Z","updated_at":"2025-10-22T12:04:18Z","body":"Just to clarify, Godot doesn't have an LTS version in the way this is usually meant. Our currently supported releases are 4.5.x, 4.4.x, and 3.6.x. All of these are on a best-effort basis and for 3.x there are very few contributors available.\n\nStill, 3.6.2 is ready and it's just a matter of getting builds published, which is likely to be done this week. But again this depends on a single person being available (me) and I'm busy with a million other responsibilities.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3432031002/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3435388005","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110852#issuecomment-3435388005","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110852","id":3435388005,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Mw9xl","user":{"login":"jahkosha","id":207419646,"node_id":"U_kgDODFz4_g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207419646?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha","html_url":"https://github.com/jahkosha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jahkosha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-23T06:36:25Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T06:36:25Z","body":"I totally appreciate that @akien-mga, I'm an open source contributor myself and my days are not long enough.\n\nWhich is why I did propose to give you a hand. My _very specific_ problem is that I'm using an OS that makes it very hard to build export template (NixOS), so if I make the effort of putting in place a virtual environment to build the engine + the templates I could very well help you cut an official release... instead of having others (and you) waste their efforts as well.\n\nI hope my message did not come as negative, I really tried to phrase it in a way that does not make it sounds like I'm complaining... I'm feeling extremely grateful that I can use freely an open source engine to build a video game, which is anyway for me just a hobby (I'm not making any profit, my games are free and without ads... so I won't starve under a bridge if my game get de listed).\n\nAgain if as you said \"3.6.2 is ready and it's just a matter of getting builds published\" it would be nice if someone from the community could assist you in that -what I believe to be- very time-consuming task while you could be busy writing algorithms.\n\nThat being said, I understand there is also some very important trust concern when it comes to cutting an official release.\n\nOne thing for sure, nothing prevent us (like anyone) from cutting a non-official release and putting it \"somewhere\", if you think that could make your lifer easier in the future (by releasing the pressure you are feeling right now) I would be happy to put the time and effort into it. I'm very serious, I just -realistically- won't have the time (due to my lack of expertise) to achieve this before the deadline this time.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3435388005/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3435500570","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110852#issuecomment-3435500570","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110852","id":3435500570,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MxZQa","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-23T07:20:41Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T07:24:23Z","body":"I appreciate the offer, but indeed making official releases is something that can't really be delegated.\n\nThe main blocker was updating the build containers to have modern toolchains (notably Xcode) and have Mono compiled with 16 KB page size: \n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot-mono-builds/pull/92\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot-mono-builds/pull/91\n\nA contributor could technically have done the above but that requires a lot of expertise in build systems, containers, patching Mono and LLVM, so it's not something I could reasonable just put as \"up for grabs\" and hope that a contributor would solve it in due time for release before the Google cut-off.\n\nAnyway all the work is now done and 3.6.2-stable is already compiling on the build server. Making builds is not time consuming once all the build environment is in place, but the ever changing requirements of mobile platforms is what makes it a drag to have to update the build environment and dependencies. Patching a 5 year old unmaintained Mono branch to support latest LLVM is never trivial.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3435500570/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3436245921","html_url":